---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Architecture & Zero-Data Guarantee – fastbgremove.com"
  description="Learn about our 100% client-side privacy architecture. 0 bytes of image data ever leave your browser RAM."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 sm:py-12 space-y-10">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#b47818] dark:text-[#E5A93C] bg-[#E5A93C]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-md border border-[#E5A93C]/20 font-semibold">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#E5A93C]"></span>
        <span>ZERO-SERVER PRIVACY GUARANTEE</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#26251e] dark:text-white">
        Privacy by Architecture: Zero Uploads
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#807d72] dark:text-[#706e68]">
        Policy Effective: 2026 • Verified Client-Side Isolation
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#5a5852] dark:text-[#a09c92]">
      <!-- 1. The Zero-Upload Guarantee -->
      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1c1f] border border-[#e6e5e0] dark:border-[#2e2e33] shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#26251e] dark:text-white">1. The Zero-Upload Technical Guarantee</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          At fastbgremove.com, privacy is not a discretionary promise—it is an immutable mathematical guarantee enforced by browser isolation. When you select, drag-and-drop, or paste an image onto fastbgremove.com:
        </p>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-md bg-[#f7f7f4] dark:bg-[#121212] border border-[#e6e5e0] dark:border-[#2e2e33] text-xs font-mono text-[#26251e] dark:text-[#ededed]">
          <strong>Exact Transmitted Payload:</strong> 0 Bytes (Zero image packets leave browser RAM)
        </div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          All pixel buffers, color values, and alpha transparency masks are evaluated locally inside your computer or mobile device's WebAssembly sandbox. We operate zero cloud image processing infrastructure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. Technical Verification (How to Inspect) -->
      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1c1f] border border-[#e6e5e0] dark:border-[#2e2e33] shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#26251e] dark:text-white">2. Independent Verification (DevTools Audit)</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          You can inspect and verify our claims at any time using your web browser's built-in developer tools:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 pl-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>Press <kbd class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-[#efeee8] dark:bg-[#242428] border border-[#cfcdc4] dark:border-[#3e3e44] font-mono text-[11px]">F12</kbd> or right-click anywhere and choose <strong>Inspect</strong>.</li>
          <li>Navigate to the <strong>Network</strong> tab and filter by <strong>Fetch / XHR</strong>.</li>
          <li>Drop an image into the workspace and initiate background removal.</li>
          <li>Observe that no POST, PUT, or binary multipart requests containing your image are generated.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Regulatory Compliance -->
      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1c1f] border border-[#e6e5e0] dark:border-[#2e2e33] shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#26251e] dark:text-white">3. Regulatory & Corporate Compliance</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Because fastbgremove.com does not collect, receive, or store personal biometric photos or documents:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-[#26251e] dark:text-white">GDPR & UK GDPR:</strong> Inherently compliant through complete data localization to the user's hardware.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#26251e] dark:text-white">HIPAA & Medical Documents:</strong> Safe for patient identification cards, medical photos, and pathology records.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#26251e] dark:text-white">Corporate Confidentiality (NDAs):</strong> Safe for unreleased product prototypes, internal executive portraits, and legal signatures.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. Local Model Weights Caching -->
      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1c1f] border border-[#e6e5e0] dark:border-[#2e2e33] shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#26251e] dark:text-white">4. Local Browser Caching</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          The machine learning segmentation model weights (~20MB) are downloaded on initial load and stored in your browser's persistent cache. Future background removal tasks execute with zero network delay and function completely offline.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Return to Workspace -->
      <div class="pt-2 text-center">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-md bg-[#E5A93C] hover:bg-[#D49B28] active:bg-[#c28c20] text-zinc-950 font-bold text-sm shadow-xs hover:shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(229,169,60,0.4)] transition-all cursor-pointer"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
          </svg>
          <span>Return to Workspace</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
